# Scoped deliberately narrowly. 46 files in this repository are committed with
# CRLF, so a repository-wide `text=auto eol=lf` would renormalize ~170 files and
# bury any real change. That cleanup is worth doing, but on its own.
#
# These three scripts must stay LF: they are executed directly, and a CRLF
# shebang makes the kernel look for an interpreter whose name ends in \r.
/build.sh text eol=lf
/run-ui.sh text eol=lf
/.cursor/install.sh text eol=lf
